 "style": ".fk{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr auto;gap:14px;height:100%}.fk-head h1{font-family:var(--ig-display);font-weight:var(--ig-display-weight);letter-spacing:var(--ig-display-tracking);font-size:27px;line-height:1.1;margin:0}.fk-head p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--ig-secondary)}.fk-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr 1.1fr;gap:18px;min-height:0}.fk-col{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--ig-hairline);border-radius:var(--ig-radius);padding:12px 14px 8px;background:var(--ig-card)}.fk-col h2{margin:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ig-accent-text)}.fk-col svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}.fk-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ig-muted);border-top:1px solid var(--ig-hairline);padding-top:6px}",
 "body": "<div class='fk'><div class='fk-head'><h1>One SQL statement locked this agent's failure. Replaying 50 futures finds the step.</h1><p>Task t4: albums per artist, 3 decimals (gold 1.701). In the transcript, no step looks wrong.</p></div><div class='fk-cols'><section class='fk-col' id='one-run'><h2>What does one agent run hide?</h2><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' role='img' aria-label='The real t4 run as a vertical path with ghost branches the sampler could have taken'><path class='ig-fig-edge' d='M78 34 L78 62' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M78 70 C 130 78, 200 74, 262 62'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M78 70 C 128 88, 198 92, 258 88'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M78 70 C 126 98, 192 110, 250 116'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='268' y='92' fill='var(--ig-muted)'>49 other drafts</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='268' y='106' fill='var(--ig-muted)'>never sampled</text><circle class='ig-fig-solid-accent' cx='78' cy='70' r='5'/><text class='ig-fig-kicker' x='92' y='74'>decision step d = 0</text><path class='ig-fig-edge' d='M78 76 L78 96' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><rect class='ig-fig-node' x='14' y='8' width='240' height='26' rx='5'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='24' y='25'>User: average albums per artist?</text><rect class='ig-fig-node' x='14' y='100' width='290' height='40' rx='5'/><text class='ig-fig-mono' x='24' y='117'>sql_query: SELECT COUNT(*) /</text><text class='ig-fig-mono' x='24' y='131'>COUNT(DISTINCT ArtistId) FROM Album</text><path class='ig-fig-edge' d='M78 140 L78 160' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><rect class='ig-fig-node' x='14' y='164' width='290' height='40' rx='5'/><text class='ig-fig-mono' x='24' y='181'>{\"AverageAlbumsPerArtist\": 1}</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='24' y='196' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>integer division: valid result, no error</text><circle class='ig-fig-solid-accent' cx='78' cy='222' r='5'/><text class='ig-fig-kicker' x='92' y='226'>decision step d = 1</text><path class='ig-fig-edge' d='M78 204 L78 216'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-danger' d='M78 228 L78 246' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><rect class='ig-fig-field-danger' x='14' y='250' width='290' height='42' rx='5'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='24' y='268'>\u201cThe answer is 1.000.\u201d</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='24' y='284' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>confident close \u00b7 gold answer: 1.701</text></svg></section><section class='fk-col' id='replay'><h2>How does forkscope measure one decision step?</h2><svg viewBox='0 0 300 300' role='img' aria-label='The prefix frozen at step d, fifty continuations fanning out to executed outcomes, tallied into the outcome distribution o d'><rect class='ig-fig-node-strong' x='55' y='10' width='190' height='40' rx='5'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='150' y='27' text-anchor='middle'>prefix up to step d</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='150' y='42' text-anchor='middle' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>frozen verbatim, chat + tool schema</text><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 90 110, 45 150, 34 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 100 112, 60 154, 56 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 112 114, 76 158, 78 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 128 118, 108 160, 108 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 140 120, 126 162, 126 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 150 122, 144 164, 144 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 160 122, 162 164, 162 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 172 120, 180 162, 180 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 186 118, 198 160, 198 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 200 114, 222 156, 226 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 212 112, 240 152, 248 192'/><path class='ig-fig-edge-mute' d='M150 52 C 222 110, 256 148, 268 192'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='150' y='106' text-anchor='middle' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>K = 50 full continuations</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='150' y='121' text-anchor='middle' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>every tool call really executed</text><circle class='ig-fig-solid-good' cx='34' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-good' cx='56' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-good' cx='78' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='108' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='126' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='144' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='162' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='180' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid-danger' cx='198' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid' cx='226' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid' cx='248' cy='200' r='6'/><circle class='ig-fig-solid' cx='268' cy='200' r='6'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='56' y='226' text-anchor='middle'>11 correct</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='153' y='226' text-anchor='middle'>29 integer-division</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='247' y='226' text-anchor='middle'>10 other</text><path class='ig-fig-edge' d='M26 240 L276 240'/><text class='ig-fig-kicker' x='150' y='262' text-anchor='middle'>the tally is o_d</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='150' y='278' text-anchor='middle' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>P(outcome | everything up to step d)</text></svg></section><section class='fk-col' id='lock'><h2>Which step locked the failure?</h2><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' role='img' aria-label='The outcome mix at d equals zero collapsing to a single outcome after the first SQL, in both directions'><text class='ig-fig-kicker' x='16' y='22'>o_d at d = 0 \u00b7 a real mix</text><rect class='ig-fig-solid-good' x='16' y='34' width='64' height='24'/><rect class='ig-fig-solid-danger' x='80' y='34' width='168' height='24'/><rect class='ig-fig-solid' x='248' y='34' width='58' height='24'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='16' y='74'>0.22 correct</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='120' y='74'>0.58 integer-division</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='250' y='74' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>0.20 other</text><path class='ig-fig-edge-strong' d='M100 92 C 90 130, 80 150, 72 168' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><text class='ig-fig-mono' x='16' y='152' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>AVG .. GROUP BY</text><path class='ig-fig-edge-danger' d='M220 92 C 230 130, 240 150, 248 168' marker-end='url(#ig-arrow)'/><text class='ig-fig-mono' x='212' y='152' fill='var(--ig-secondary)'>COUNT / COUNT</text><text class='ig-fig-kicker' x='16' y='190'>o_d at d = 1 \u00b7 collapsed</text><rect class='ig-fig-solid-good' x='16' y='200' width='140' height='24'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='16' y='240'>1.00 correct \u00b7 locked</text><rect class='ig-fig-solid-danger' x='180' y='200' width='140' height='24'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='180' y='240'>1.00 integer-division \u00b7 locked</text><path class='ig-fig-rule' d='M16 258 L320 258'/><text class='ig-fig-label' x='16' y='280'>the collapse between the two readings is the fork:</text><text class='ig-fig-label' x='16' y='294'>after this step, no amount of sampling recovers</text></svg></section></div></div>"
